  "prefLabel": "Agr 503.12 Information About Meat and Meat Products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 503.12 Information About Meat and Meat Products. The information submitted about meat and meat products shall include the plant number of the plant where the product was processed and passed inspection by the United States Department of Agriculture.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr500.html"
